&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our global Customer Engagement team in Berlin, we are looking for a Lifecycle Marketing Manager to own the lifecycle strategy for one of our core topics: AOV, merchandising, partnerships &amp;amp; retail media, or unpausing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer Engagement sits within the HelloFresh Group’s Global Customer Lifecycle organization. Our mission is simple: keep active customers active, and make sure they get the most out of their subscription — across our 6 brands, 18 countries and 30 markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lifecycle Marketing Manager, you’ll be a critical link between strategy and execution, partnering closely with CRM, Product Marketing, Physical Product, Tech and local marketing teams to design, brief and scale programs that keep our customers engaged with their subscription.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the lifecycle strategy deployment for your topic area and translate it into programs and campaigns that keep customers engaged with their subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Physical Product and Tech to spot opportunities that improve the customer experience and support your topic’s goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief campaigns end-to-end to CRM Operations and Creative teams, ensuring messaging, targeting and execution meet our lifecycle and brand standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with local market teams across our 30 markets to adapt and roll out global strategy, balancing consistency with local relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to test, measure and continuously optimize campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on the health of your topic area, flagging risks and opportunities to the wider Customer Engagement team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-topic initiatives across the Customer Engagement team as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen — experience operating in a highly commercial function (not necessarily CRM), with the ability to bridge lifecycle marketing thinking with commercial opportunities, and to create opportunity rather than just streamline execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A successful experience (3+ years) in CRM, lifecycle marketing, product marketing or a similar role, ideally in a subscription, e-commerce or FMCG environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, with experience briefing and managing cross-functional stakeholders (CRM Operations, Creative, Tech, local teams)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset — comfortable using data to inform decisions and optimize campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities independently, across global and local stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; &lt;em&gt;notions of German, French, Dutch, Swedish, Norwegian or Danish is a plus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited about driving measurable reactivation uplift across the world, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R367&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the unified data, analytics and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain first‑mover advantage in today’s ultra‑competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion across Central Europe, we are looking for a creative, execution‑oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the team in Germany and maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the automotive/OEM vertical. Reporting to our Senior Director of Enterprise Sales, you will focus on building relationships and closing new business opportunities within one of Germany’s largest automotive/OEM company. You will be part of an account team supporting this highly strategic client. Leveraging your consultative sales experience in the automotive/OEM vertical, you will help shape the data and AI strategy, identify and progress high-value opportunities, and deliver tangible business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-quiet list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will take ownership of your flagship account, define a clear strategy, and relentlessly drive it to exceed revenue and consumption goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will turn that strategy into action, executing with urgency and discipline to consistently overachieve your targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will build boardroom‑level relationships, becoming the trusted advisor on all things data and AI for senior stakeholders up to and including C‑level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will uncover and shape new business, expanding use cases and driving deeper platform consumption across your account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will orchestrate the full Databricks ecosystem, mobilising internal teams to maximise impact and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will demonstrate compelling value in every engagement, leading confident, insight‑led negotiations that take opportunities all the way to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;What we look for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;A proven record of exceeding revenue targets in complex enterprise sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Recognised automotive domain expertise, applied to expanding strategic automotive/OEM accounts in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;711&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Proven success selling data, analytics, big data, AI, or other highly technical cloud software solutions through complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-year enterprise sales cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify high-impact data and AI use cases and engage key buying centres to expand Databricks’ footprint and strategic relevance within an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of consumption-based, land-and-expand models, with the ability to drive sustained growth within a single strategic account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and shape demand, translating customer priorities into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Disciplined use of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, account planning, Value Selling, or Command of the Message, combined with strong pipeline management and accurate forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;A track record of building executive-level champions and cross-functional account teams to execute against a defined account and territory strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Experience developing and executing partner strategies that extend reach, accelerate deal velocity, and support complex enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Willing and able to travel to customer sites, company and industry events - regionally and internationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English, with the credibility to engage, challenge, and influence senior stakeholders up to C-level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the data and AI company. More than 10,000 organizations worldwide — including Comcast, Condé Nast, Grammarly, and over 50% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform to unify and democratize data, analytics and AI. Databricks is headquartered in San Francisco, with offices around the globe and was founded by the original creators of Lakehouse, Apache Spark™, Delta Lake and MLflow. To learn more, follow Databricks on&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://twitter.com/databricks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://twitter.com/databricks&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw03FL8fJvOD97ytN02f5G2C&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw15dLk3q8VxTfHEgCUg7NSt&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 54, 33);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1700237575733000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw39EcncitnlqV72EG2-RqXJ&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Global Integrated B2B Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the end-to-end marketing direction for one of Wolt’s most strategic B2B business units. You will act as the marketing lead for Wolt for Work or Commerce Platform, responsible for turning business goals into clear priorities, strong narratives, and focused go-to-market execution across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is about direction, judgment, and orchestration. You will work with specialized B2B marketing functions such as product marketing, content, paid, lifecycle, events, creative, brand, and PR, who own craft and execution. Your job is to make sense of it all, ask the hard questions, challenge assumptions, and ensure everything ladders up to one cohesive strategy that drives growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate as a senior, trusted partner to product and commercial leaders, leading through influence rather than people management, and acting as a force multiplier for the entire marketing organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role, you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global integrated marketing strategy and initiative roadmap for Wolt for Work, aligned with business, product, sales, and regional priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main marketing lead for the Wolt for Work business unit, partnering closely with global and local product and commercial stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business goals into clear, focused 360-degree marketing plans across the funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together product marketing, content, paid, lifecycle, events, brand, creative, and PR into cohesive GTM programs, while functions own execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own selected global and market-level initiatives end-to-end, from problem definition to delivery and impact measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define priorities and make clear tradeoffs to ensure focus on the highest-impact opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the Wolt for Work narrative in the market, including brand positioning, key messages, and external storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics across awareness, adoption, and revenue, turning performance into clear insights and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage allocated campaign budgets with accountability for impact and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps, missed opportunities, and risks early, and actively push for better focus, quality, and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive alignment and momentum across teams and senior stakeholders without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning integrated B2B marketing in a complex, fast-moving, or multi-market environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional marketing background, with hands-on understanding of demand generation, product marketing, lifecycle, content, and brand, even if you did not specialize in all of them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic and commercial mindset, comfortable owning direction, prioritization, and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to challenge, ask tough questions, and push for clarity while remaining collaborative and constructive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create structure and focus in ambiguous or loosely defined situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead through influence and build trust with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, including defining KPIs and using data to guide decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident communicator who can align teams around a shared direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent (C2-level) in English and German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS, platforms, or multi-product B2B businesses is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to build something meaningful and global, surrounded by kind and ambitious people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to shape how Wolt’s B2B products reach and impact businesses across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lots of learning, growth, and ownership in a high-growth tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits, including eligibility for our long-term incentive plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely supportive culture that values diversity, curiosity, and getting better every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the challenge you’ve been looking for, we’d love to hear from you! Submit your application, and our Talent Acquisition Partner will be in touch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hiring process typically includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory chat with our TA team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A conversation with the Hiring Manager and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical task or case study (for relevant roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interviews with the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review applications on a rolling basis — so apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;720&quot; height=&quot;404&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Munich, Bavaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: €60,000 base salary + uncapped commission (circa €100,000+ OTE)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenTable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the face of OpenTable in your territory, owning the entire sales cycle from prospecting and relationship building through to negotiation and closing. In this field-based role, you will work across Stuttgart, spending a significant portion of your time meeting restaurant partners in person and the remainder working remotely. You will help restaurants grow revenue and improve operations by introducing technology that supports reservations, front-of-house management, and guest experience. This role requires professional fluency in German and English and a strong ability to build credibility with restaurant operators in a competitive market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t have an office in Germany so you&#39;ll spend much of your week meeting restaurant operators face-to-face across your territory, helping build trusted relationships and close new business.This field-based role combines home working with regular travel across your territory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and win new restaurant business within an assigned territory to grow OpenTable’s network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver tailored in-person and virtual product demonstrations that clearly connect OpenTable’s solutions to each partner’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with restaurant operators, share relevant market insights, and help them think differently about opportunities in their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop territory plans, manage pipeline activity, forecast accurately, and process contracts using Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet or exceed monthly and quarterly acquisition and revenue targets while navigating objections and competitive pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share customer feedback with internal teams and represent OpenTable through networking, events, and ongoing engagement with the hospitality community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consultative business-to-business enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success meeting or exceeding sales targets in a consultative sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery, negotiation, presentation, and time management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and build a business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace and Salesforce, a bachelor’s degree, and the ability to travel regularly within Germany for a field-based role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling software, hospitality technology, payments, or related solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in restaurant management or sales within the food and beverage industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using customer and market insights to improve sales strategy and provide product feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing a company through industry networking and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in hospitality and technology, with a collaborative and learning-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note; we have a global recruitment team, so ask that your Resume is submitted in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get at&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.opentable.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenTable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great work happens when people feel trusted, supported &amp;amp; excited about what they do — so we offer benefits designed to support your life, wellbeing &amp;amp; growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Flexibility that actually feels flexible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to &lt;strong&gt;20 days per year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 vacation days per year&lt;/strong&gt;, 2 days off off your wedding, one for moving &amp;amp; &lt;strong&gt;your birthday off&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual &lt;strong&gt;company-wide recharge week&lt;/strong&gt; where the whole business fully switches off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 Support for your wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company-paid therapy&lt;/strong&gt; through Spring Health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Headspace subscription&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;24/7 GP access&lt;/strong&gt;, legal support &amp;amp; more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income protection &amp;amp; life assurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Investment in your growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; to support your learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership development opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to &lt;strong&gt;thousands of on-demand courses &amp;amp; learning resources&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ The extras that make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid volunteer days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive pension contributions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Resource Groups &amp;amp; inclusive communities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-FF1&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FULL-TIME JOB VACANCY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;France Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocacy Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paris Office&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline: 23 August 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Human Rights Watch (HRW) is seeking applicants for the position of France Director to develop and implement advocacy and media engagement strategies before the French government and its key organs and institutions, on the full range of countries and foreign policy issues addressed by the organization, including those dealt with by EU institutions. Serving as a key advocacy and communications strategist, the France Director will ensure the highest standards of quality and efficacy for HRW’s diverse advocacy and media efforts and help transform HRW’s research into concrete improvements in human rights practices within France, or in its foreign and security policy, or by leveraging its influence within the UN, EU, and other multilateral institutions of which France is a member.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will function as our link to policy- and decision-makers and the media on our global portfolio of issues, as well as on domestic human rights concerns. In advance of the 2027 elections, we are seeking an effective leader, strategic thinker and compelling communicator to lead HRW’s advocacy and media in France. They will also oversee our Paris office, work directly with HRW’s France Works Council, and build a culture in which staff from a broad range of backgrounds can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The France Director will have a solid understanding of the current human rights landscape domestically and overseas, a strong track record of engaging with policy circles and the wider public, a sophisticated grasp of the media landscape and be a compelling public speaker. This position is based in Paris, willing to work from the office [as needed/3-4 days per week], and reports to the Chief Advocacy Officer (“CAO”).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The France Director will supervise an Advocacy Officer and work closely with a Communications Manager in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;French Advocacy and Media:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead HRW’s advocacy in France and work with HRW colleagues to develop and implement advocacy and media strategies on the full range of countries and issues addressed by HRW, including domestic issues in France;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the work of HRW in France to influence decisionmakers, mainly key high-level officials at the Elysée, Foreign Ministry, Matignon, Parliament, and other government ministries and agencies as necessary, building access to and staying in regular contact with key policymakers and departments, working with members of Parliament, speaking at public events and seminars, influencing think tanks and other policy/advisory bodies, interacting with NGO partners in the human rights movement on a national and international stage; and otherwise leveraging France to be a more consistent actor for human rights worldwide;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In close coordination with the Communications team, act as a spokesperson in French media ; support HRW’s strategy to promote its work effectively to traditional and social media in France, reinforce its influence and advance growth and engagement of the French audience, including by: building relevant relationships and contacts with journalists and media outlets; writing and speaking on human rights issues; telling compelling stories, crafting succinct soundbites and messages, and deploying diverse and innovative storytelling skills to promote human rights values to the broader public. Help HRW colleagues understand how and when to seize press and advocacy opportunities in France, both on global and domestic issues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate closely with HRW advocates around the globe, at the UN (based in New York and Geneva), at the EU (based in Brussels), the Advocacy Director of the Europe and Central Asia Division on all EU- and ECA-related advocacy, respectively, as well as other advocates working on EU member states. Collaborate with the various parts of HRW, including the Advocacy and Media teams around the globe, to identify and create opportunities that support research and advocacy efforts involving France and the EU;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in partnership with the France Development Director to build relationships with donors and financial prospects by representing HRW – sharing research, advocacy and impact – in an authentic and inspiring way;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with non-governmental organizations, civil society partners, and other key actors on collaborative advocacy efforts, strengthening strategic partnerships as appropriate;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal HRW policies and strategic debates. Provide regular information, political analysis, perspective, and guidance on France’s human rights policies to the organization, and the foreign and security implications derived from them, in particular to regional and thematic divisions and HRW’s other advocates;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other responsibilities, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paris Office Leader&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a leader to currently approximately 20 HRW staff based in France, building and strengthening a sense of community, connection and trust with the wider organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an HRW representative in corporate governance matters for the local entity, supported by Finance, the General Counsel’s office, and other relevant departments, where applicable. This includes attendance at, and oversight of documents required for local entity board meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a signatory to relevant bank accounts and authorize payments when needed, adhering to HRW’s financial policies and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In coordination with Global Human Resources, act as a signatory on local employment contracts, immigration forms, and other employment-related documents. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in partnership with the Operations Office Administrator (OA), Regional Operations Director, senior leadership and the HRW France Works Council to support information sharing with office staff on organizational developments, issues and resources and elevating concerns and needs of office staff to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a representative of the HRW France legal entity in relation to the HRW France Works Council and seek to maintain an approach of constructive engagement with this body.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work to build and maintain an inclusive environment by holding regular staff meetings, helping to create a safe space with open communication for staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with Global Human Resources, the General Counsel’s Office and the HRW France Works Council in cases of office grievances, personal conduct issues, investigations or other serious matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main point of contact during security situations, responsible for participating in the development and review of office security plans and accounting for staff in collaboration with the OA, Regional Operations Director, Director of Physical Security, Director of Information Security, and the HRW France Works Council.22&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;: A graduate degree in in international relations, journalism, law, social sciences or equivalent work experience is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: A minimum of ten years of policy advocacy work experience, including at least four years of management experience, is required. Work experience in an international environment, with culturally diverse teams and across multiple time zones, is strongly desired.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Related Skills and Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial knowledge of the French political landscape, government ministries and agencies, and direct experience performing policy advocacy with one or more of these bodies is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant human rights experience and expertise, and a demonstrated commitment to human rights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be an effective, concise public speaker and possess excellent speaking, writing, and editing skills in English and French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment and excellent analytical and strategic-thinking capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated management skills, with the ability to lead, support, and motivate colleagues, navigate complex interpersonal dynamics, foster trust and collaboration, and contribute to an inclusive and respectful working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work quickly and effectively under pressure; the capacity to pay close attention to detail while working in a fast-paced environment and juggling multiple tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coordination skills and the ability to work effectively independently, as part of a team, and in partnership with other organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Salary and Benefits&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;HRW seeks exceptional applicants and offers competitive compensation and generous employer-paid benefits.&amp;nbsp; The salary range for this role is EUR 112,000–132,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;How to Apply:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Please apply immediately or by &lt;strong&gt;23 August, 2026,&lt;/strong&gt; by visiting our online job portal at careers.hrw.org and uploading a cover letter and a resume/CV, in PDF format.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Please keep your cover letter to no longer than one page in length, and please be sure to highlight your relevant qualifications.&amp;nbsp; No calls or email inquiries, please. Only complete applications will be reviewed and only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are experiencing technical difficulties with your application submission, please email ----- Due to the large response, application submissions via email will not be accepted and inquiries regarding the status of applications will go unanswered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Human Rights Watch is strong because it is diverse.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We actively seek a diverse applicant pool and encourage candidates of all backgrounds to apply. Human Rights Watch does not discriminate on the basis of disability, age, gender identity and expression, national origin, race and ethnicity, religious beliefs, sexual orientation, or criminal record. We welcome all kinds of diversity. Our employees include people who are parents and nonparents, the self-taught and university educated, and from a wide span of socio-economic backgrounds and perspectives on the world. Human Rights Watch is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Human Rights Watch&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; is an international human rights monitoring and advocacy organization known for its in-depth investigations, its incisive and timely reporting, its innovative and high-profile advocacy campaigns, and its success in changing the human rights-related policies and practices of influential governments and international institutions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;142&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;145&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;165&quot; data-end=&quot;307&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a sharp, commercially-minded finance leader to own our Germany and AMEA Expansion Market&#39;s financial strategy and lay the foundations for European expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;593&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll act as the central voice on performance, forecasting, and financial decision-making. From CAC and contribution margin to free cash flow and scenario planning, you’ll be responsible for turning financial insight into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;595&quot; data-end=&quot;877&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with cross-functional leaders across growth, operations, product, and care to shape the our Germany and AMEA Expansion Market&#39;s financial trajectory, while ensuring the business runs efficiently and invests wisely. This is a high-trust, high-impact role where the stakes, and the pace, are high.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;1035&quot;&gt;While this role is DE and Expansion market focused today, it has clear runway to grow into a broader European leadership role as we expand across new markets and business lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1045&quot; data-end=&quot;1079&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Responsible For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1113&quot;&gt;Own the Germany and AMEA Expansion Market financial model&lt;/strong&gt; — Build and manage end-to-end models for revenue, CAC, LTV, margin, and free cash flow. Your outputs will guide day-to-day decisions and long-term bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1410&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1298&quot;&gt;Lead the planning process&lt;/strong&gt; — Drive monthly re-forecasting, annual planning, and scenario modelling in close collaboration with Group FP&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Be the commercial partner to growth and ops&lt;/strong&gt; — Set CAC and payback targets, assess performance by cohort, and guide spend allocation to maximise ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Run commercial analysis that unlocks growth&lt;/strong&gt; — Lead deep dives into pricing, retention, margin, and expansion levers to identify opportunities and recommend trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1920&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Make the numbers visible&lt;/strong&gt; — Build dashboards and trackers for key DE performance metrics (e.g. contribution margin, CAC, LTV, cash flow), keeping the business tightly aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Ensure clean, accurate financial operations&lt;/strong&gt; — Partner with Group Finance on reconciliations, cost allocation, and timely month-end closes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;Build for scale&lt;/strong&gt; — Design financial systems and insights that don’t just serve the German markets, but become the blueprint for future markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot;&gt;6+ years in strategic finance&lt;/strong&gt;, FP&amp;amp;A, consulting, or banking, with experience in high-growth or tech-enabled businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2384&quot; data-end=&quot;2521&quot;&gt;Proven experience owning &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2409&quot; data-end=&quot;2450&quot;&gt;P&amp;amp;L and end-to-end planning processes&lt;/strong&gt; — ideally in a business with both consumer and operational complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2633&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2546&quot; data-end=&quot;2587&quot;&gt;CAC, LTV, payback, cash flow dynamics&lt;/strong&gt;, and how these fuel long-term value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2636&quot; data-end=&quot;2742&quot;&gt;Highly proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2657&quot; data-end=&quot;2682&quot;&gt;Google Sheets / Excel&lt;/strong&gt; (bonus points for SQL, Looker, NetSuite, or similar tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2745&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;Strong commercial instincts — you&#39;re as comfortable in the numbers as you are helping teams make smart, trade-off decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2871&quot; data-end=&quot;2901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2875&quot; data-end=&quot;2901&quot;&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; Attitudes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2905&quot; data-end=&quot;2980&quot;&gt;You &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2909&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot;&gt;move fast&lt;/strong&gt; and bias toward action, even without perfect information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2983&quot; data-end=&quot;3064&quot;&gt;You bring a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2995&quot; data-end=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;strong point of view&lt;/strong&gt;, but you’re open to challenge and new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3067&quot; data-end=&quot;3159&quot;&gt;You get energy from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3114&quot;&gt;messy, complex problems&lt;/strong&gt; and know how to bring structure and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3162&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;You &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3166&quot; data-end=&quot;3182&quot;&gt;own outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, not just analysis — you want to see your insights drive performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3255&quot; data-end=&quot;3344&quot;&gt;You’re calm under pressure, confident with ambiguity, and committed to delivering impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, and skincare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

