&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typically we look for 5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in retail marketing, space planning, visual merchandising, or brand-concept rollouts within multi-site retail or wholesale environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail &amp;amp; VM Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring a strong track record of executing physical retail marketing and space planning initiatives in dynamic, multi-site or wholesale channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Project Management Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at managing complex project roadmaps, coordinating POS production workflows, and directing external agencies and production vendors to deliver seamless campaign rollouts on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; You act as a trusted regional partner, adept at collaborating across internal marketing, sales, and external strategic retail stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Analytical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring structured project management to fast-paced environments—balancing project budgets, tracking delivery metrics, and establishing seamless operational flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; You are meticulous with follow-ups, ensuring operational excellence, brand consistency, and commercial impact across all touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
